          "title": "Lost Cities",
          "subtitle": "Vying",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Lost Cities is a commercial two-player card game by Reiner Knizia where players commit cards to expeditions and race for efficient scores."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Designed by Reiner Knizia and published by Kosmos and Rio Grande Games in 1999, Lost Cities is a two-player hand-management card game built around risked expeditions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
